'''Obo''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Walk of Fame}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. He guards the {{Zone|Cerebral Citadel}} and refuses entry without a {{Item|Shen's Ringalia}} in the inventory or equipped.

